<title>MALAYSIA: Telekom Malaysia shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Telekom Malaysia shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Telekom Malaysia Bhd were suspended on Thursday at the request of the company, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Telekom officials could not be immediately reached for comment.  </p>
<p>A consortium of Telekom Malaysia and SBC Communications Inc on Wednesday signed a deal with the South African government, to buy a 30 percent stake in Telkom for $1.26 billion.</p>
<p>Telekom has a 40 percent interest in the consortium.</p>
<p>Telekom stock closed at 19.00 ringgit on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
